{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>程式碼探索者 pdfu 分享的發現顯示，Apple 可能正研究讓 Apple Maps 的抵達時間估算一併考慮泊車及前往目的地的步行時間。iOS 27.3 測試版中出現一個名為 TimeToPark 的新旗標，據稱可量度用戶在目的地附近至泊車前所花時間，以及泊車後步行時間。</p>\n<h2>TimeToPark 測泊車與步行時間</h2>\n<p>相關測量會使用背景位置及動作數據，結果按每次行程儲存，並按星期與小時分組。</p>\n<p>不過，pdfu 指出該功能目前只能在內部安裝版本中啟用，亦尚未有任何 Maps 功能使用這些數據。換言之，可計入泊車時間的預計抵達時間仍可能出現，惟目前尚未投入實際應用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Apple-Store-Front.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.165682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T12:36:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:36:13.264209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:23.992677+00:00","content_hash":"cd8a08f855cad4dbc7a553f2ce5ff149c026f812d13beed25ccc812d09603cdd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.165682+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}